Description: Performance monitoring and benchmarking suite (gnu15, OpenHPC)
 LIKWID is a toolsuite of command line applications for performance oriented
 programmers. It works for Intel, AMD and ARMv8 processors on the Linux
 operating system.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
